Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:10:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1045/1252] The Collection keeps you in the Collection: a peek
 on hover, a sheet on click

A pointer resting 400 ms on a card shows a peek: title, age, length, mode, 200 characters of the
style, the first 20 lines of the lyrics, the note. A click on a title opens the take's sheet over
the Collection: play/pause (following the player), like, dislike, favourite, the whole style and
lyrics, the note (edited in place), workspaces, what is made from it; Open in Create and Open in
Post are the only ways out to another tab (Viktor: Create by a deliberate choice). Esc or a click
outside closes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
